{"id":"615609","name":"海肠荠菜千层饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615609/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面团","amount":"70g"},{"name":"馅料","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"荠菜剁成末，海肠切碎。","img":"images/615609/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放食用油，鸡精，食盐和生抽。","img":"images/615609/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀。这是早上调的馅。","img":"images/615609/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"剩的面。","img":"images/615609/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取一块面团。","img":"images/615609/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"擀皮，如图切开。","img":"images/615609/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"铺上馅料。","img":"images/615609/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"包起来，压扁。","img":"images/615609/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/615609/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油热放馅饼。","img":"images/615609/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"一面上色翻面。","img":"images/615609/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"反复几次即可，整个会鼓起来就熟了。","img":"images/615609/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/615609/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/615609/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}